Subject: [PATCH] MAINTAINERS: Add the Apple AOP gyroscope and pressure drivers

List the AOP's gyroscope and pressure sensor drivers with the AOP
driver they are built on.

[Orchard: from orchard PR #101, commit a54e2049; the MAINTAINERS part of
 soc-apple/0015, split out because drivers/iio applies before
 drivers/soc-apple, where the AOP entry is added]

Assisted-by: LLM
---
 MAINTAINERS | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/MAINTAINERS b/MAINTAINERS
index a4a6964..12c2928 100644
--- a/MAINTAINERS
+++ b/MAINTAINERS
@@ -2068,6 +2068,8 @@ APPLE T8010 ALWAYS-ON PROCESSOR
 M:	Dalton Alexandre <alley.nightly_0b@icloud.com>
 S:	Maintained
 F:	Documentation/devicetree/bindings/soc/apple/apple,t8010-aop.yaml
+F:	drivers/iio/gyro/apple_aop_gyro.c
+F:	drivers/iio/pressure/apple_aop_pressure.c
 F:	drivers/soc/apple/aop.c
 F:	include/linux/soc/apple/aop.h
 
